= January 2024 — Who commands the prosecutors?

The justice minister says Dariusz Barski's restoration as National Prosecutor
was legally ineffective. The Palace and PiS say only the president can consent
to his removal. Regional prosecutors now need to know whose instructions are
safe to follow.

- @barski_record
- @barski_command
- @barski_bargain
- @barski_opposition_review
- @barski_opposition_attack

@barski_record
title: Publish every opinion and seek a neutral court ruling
subtitle: Slow, but it treats command clarity as a legal problem.
