Q.prosecution_command_clarity += 5;
Q.prosecution_independence += 4;
Q.government_procedural_restraint += 6;
Q.constitutional_restraint += 4;
Q.court_backlog += 2;
Q.president_judiciary_cooperation -= 1;
Q.prosecution_status = "Interim command under published legal review";
Q.news_headline = "The government puts the rival prosecution claims on the record";
!}

An acting command remains in place, but written opinions, recusals and a defined
route to judgment make it harder for either camp to rule by telephone.

- @poland_event_queue: Publish the opinions

