# prose-audit: Grade A — Barski and the surviving PiS command are introduced through the disputed 2022 restoration; opposition and PiS-coalition Lewica receive situated dilemmas, and every oversight route ends in an authority-bounded aftermath.
title: Prosecutorial command under a surviving PiS cabinet
subtitle: Barski keeps the files—and Lewica must decide whether scrutiny from outside or dissent inside can make that command answerable
