[? if left_in_government = 0: Delegates from KO, PSL and Poland 2050 agree to
one hearing calendar, one document archive and rotating chairs. Without a Sejm
majority it is not a statutory commission and cannot compel Barski to attend.
It can keep witnesses, contradictions and disputed instructions in one public
record instead of four competing press conferences.?]
[? if left_in_government = 1: Lewica's ministers sit down with KO, PSL and
Poland 2050 to scrutinise the prosecution run by their own senior coalition
partner. The panel cannot compel evidence like a statutory commission, but its
shared hearings deny PiS the protection of fragmented opposition files. PiS
calls it disloyalty. For once, participation in its cabinet does not require
Lewica to call silence responsibility.?]

- @poland_event_queue: Convene the panel


