= February 2024 — Design the repair

The justice ministry's repair plan reaches the fifteen judicial seats on the
KRS. Judges' associations want political control removed; PSL wants a public
mandate; thousands of judges appointed since 2018 need to know whether their
careers and judgments will be reviewed individually or rejected together.

- @krs_judicial_ballot
- @krs_mixed_design
- @krs_blanket_break
- @krs_opposition_conditions
