= March 2024 — Can a resolution repair a court?

Three contested appointments and the Tribunal presidency have left ministers,
judges and litigants unsure which panels they can trust. A Sejm resolution can
name that dysfunction; it cannot make the Tribunal accept the charge or tell
every official which judgment to publish tomorrow morning.

- @tk_broad_resolution
- @tk_narrow_resolution
- @tk_statute_first

