= May 2024 — The European decision does not repair a domestic court

Brussels has closed the Article 7 procedure, but Polish prosecutors still need
a lawful chain of command, judges still face a disputed KRS and court users
still meet conflicting claims about the Tribunal. We must decide whether to
bank the European victory, publish what remains or use it to force the pace.

- @article7_bank_credit
- @article7_honest_credit
- @article7_accelerate
- @article7_opposition_ledger
- @article7_opposition_statutes

