= October 2024 — The constitutional loop

President [+ president_name +] sends the repair acts to the very Tribunal they
would change. Disputed judges are now asked to review rules written for their
own seats, while litigants wait for a court whose judgments other institutions
will recognise.

[? if president_name = "Andrzej Duda": Duda presents the referral as defence of
acquired rights and legal certainty, preserving the architecture he helped
create. ?][? if president_name != "Andrzej Duda": In this timeline the
president's legal objections, rather than Duda's institutional legacy, create
the same constitutional loop. ?]

