= December 2025 — Two legal orders, one judgment

The Court of Justice finds serious defects in Tribunal appointments and in
rulings against EU-law primacy. Now lawyers ask which clients may reopen a
case, judges ask which acts still bind them, and ministries ask whether a
targeted remedy will survive the demand for total nullification.

