= March 2026 — Electing into disputed authority

Six empty chairs bring nominees before the Sejm and give the majority a chance
to change the Tribunal through a lawful vote. The appointments will not settle
every old panel or the court's presidency, and the Palace can still decide
whether the elected judges ever take their seats.

- @six_public_shortlist
- @six_coalition_slate
- @six_hold_seats
- @six_opposition_shortlist

