@appointments_conflict_2026
# prose-audit: Grade B — The payoff for an earlier signed protocol is well designed and the blocked/unblocked fork is clean, but the scene reports the delay rather than staging it, and prints its own reason string ([+ krs_appointments_reason_2026 +]) back to the player.
title: The president and the empty benches
subtitle: A signed protocol can prevent delay; an unfinished settlement cannot.
new-page: true
view-if: year = 2026 and month = 8 and government_party != "pis"
max-visits: 1
priority: 40
tags: poland_event
on-arrival: {!
const appointmentsKrsStatus = String(Q.krs_reform_status || "");
const appointmentsRightPalace = [
    "Andrzej Duda",
    "Karol Nawrocki",
    "Sławomir Mentzen",
    "Grzegorz Braun"
].includes(Q.president_name);
const appointmentsHostileAlignment =
    Boolean(Q.pres_2025_hostile_president) || appointmentsRightPalace;
const appointmentsRelation = Number(Q.president_relation) || 0;
const appointmentsCooperation =
    Number(Q.president_judiciary_cooperation) || 0;
Q.krs_signed_protocol_2026 =
    (
        Q.krs_signed_protocol_2026 ||
        appointmentsKrsStatus ==
            "Signed reform with presidential appointments protocol"
    ) ? 1 : 0;
Q.krs_palace_hostile_2026 =
    (
        appointmentsHostileAlignment &&
        appointmentsRelation < 55 && appointmentsCooperation < 55
    ) ||
    (appointmentsRelation < 30 && appointmentsCooperation < 45) ||
    (appointmentsCooperation < 25 && appointmentsRelation < 45) ? 1 : 0;
Q.krs_appointments_blocked_2026 =
    !Q.krs_signed_protocol_2026 || Q.krs_palace_hostile_2026 ? 1 : 0;
Q.krs_appointments_reason_2026 = Q.krs_signed_protocol_2026
    ? (
        Q.krs_palace_hostile_2026
            ? "The signed protocol is being obstructed by a hostile Palace"
            : "The signed appointments protocol is being honoured"
    )
    : "No signed KRS appointments settlement binds the Palace";
!}

= August 2026 — Recognition at the Palace

[? if krs_appointments_blocked_2026: President [+ president_name +] delays
recognition or appointment of judges chosen under the repaired procedures.
The record is plain: **[+ krs_appointments_reason_2026 +]**. Empty benches now
push back hearing dates and leave litigants paying for a conflict conducted at
the Palace.?]
[? if not krs_appointments_blocked_2026: The Palace follows the published
appointments timetable agreed in the signed KRS settlement. The question is
whether to verify delivery, not how to answer a blockade that did not happen.?]

- @appointments_protocol_honoured
- @appointments_public_protocol
- @appointments_general_law
- @appointments_quota
- @appointments_ignore
- @appointments_opposition_protocol
- @appointments_opposition_attack

@appointments_protocol_honoured
title: Audit delivery of the signed public appointments timetable
subtitle: The settlement works; record appointments and waiting-list relief.
view-if: krs_appointments_blocked_2026 = 0
on-arrival: {!
Q.judicial_vacancies = Math.max(
    0,
    (Number(Q.judicial_vacancies) || 0) - 6
);
Q.court_backlog = Math.max(0, (Number(Q.court_backlog) || 0) - 4);
Q.court_user_trust += 5;
Q.judicial_legitimacy += 5;
Q.president_judiciary_cooperation += 3;
Q.krs_reform_status =
    "Signed appointments protocol implemented on schedule";
Q.news_headline =
    "The Palace implements the published KRS appointments timetable";
!}

The public record shows who was appointed, when and under which criteria.
There is no invented constitutional crisis to solve after the earlier bargain
held.

- @poland_event_queue: Audit the timetable

@appointments_public_protocol
title: Negotiate a published list and timetable
subtitle: Requires a presidential channel; no secret veto over individual names.
view-if: left_in_government = 1 and krs_appointments_blocked_2026 = 1
choose-if: president_judiciary_cooperation >= 42 or president_relation >= 48
unavailable-subtitle: The Palace will discuss people only in private.
on-arrival: {!
Q.president_judiciary_cooperation += 9;
Q.president_relation += 5;
Q.judicial_vacancies -= 7;
Q.court_backlog -= 5;
Q.court_user_trust += 7;
Q.government_procedural_restraint += 6;
Q.legal_dualism -= 5;
Q.judicial_legitimacy += 6;
Q.news_headline = "A public appointments timetable reopens the benches";
!}

The Palace keeps its constitutional role and loses the ability to delay without
explanation. Published criteria make the compromise look like administration,
not a partition of the courts.

- @poland_event_queue: Publish the list

@appointments_general_law
title: Return with a general appointments and deadline law
subtitle: Slow the confrontation down and remove names from the statute.
view-if: left_in_government = 1 and krs_appointments_blocked_2026 = 1
on-arrival: {!
Q.government_procedural_restraint += 9;
Q.constitutional_restraint += 6;
Q.president_judiciary_cooperation += 2;
Q.judicial_vacancies += 2;
Q.court_backlog += 3;
Q.court_user_trust += 1;
Q.judicial_repair_mandate += 2;
Q.news_headline = "The cabinet answers appointment delay with a general deadline law";
!}

The new bill governs every president and every nominee. It will not put a judge
on an empty bench before the next round of review and veto.

- @poland_event_queue: Return with the general law

@appointments_quota
title: Trade names privately and clear the list
subtitle: Fast relief, corrosive precedent.
view-if: left_in_government = 1 and krs_appointments_blocked_2026 = 1
on-arrival: {!
Q.president_judiciary_cooperation += 8;
Q.president_relation += 6;
Q.judicial_vacancies -= 9;
Q.court_backlog -= 7;
Q.court_user_trust += 3;
Q.krs_independence -= 7;
Q.krs_democratic_accountability -= 5;
Q.government_procedural_restraint -= 8;
Q.judicial_legitimacy -= 4;
Q.razem_dissent += 7;
Q.news_headline = "A private Palace quota clears the judicial appointments";
!}

Cases move again. No one outside the room can tell whether the accepted judges
were chosen for competence, faction or reciprocal immunity.

- @poland_event_queue: Trade the names

@appointments_ignore
title: Treat the Sejm vote as sufficient and seat the judges
subtitle: Break the blockade by creating a rival appointment doctrine.
view-if: left_in_government = 1 and krs_appointments_blocked_2026 = 1
on-arrival: {!
Q.tribunal_composition_legality += 3;
Q.tribunal_domestic_recognition -= 10;
Q.judicial_vacancies -= 6;
Q.government_procedural_restraint -= 11;
Q.constitutional_restraint -= 8;
Q.president_relation -= 9;
Q.president_judiciary_cooperation -= 9;
Q.legal_dualism += 12;
Q.judicial_legitimacy -= 6;
Q.judicial_repair_mandate += 5;
Q.news_headline = "The government seats judges without presidential recognition";
!}

One set of benches is physically filled. Poland now has two appointment
doctrines and no agreed institution capable of choosing between them.

- @poland_event_queue: Seat the judges

@appointments_opposition_protocol
title: Offer votes for a public deadline and reasons protocol
subtitle: An opposition Left can make delay costly without choosing judges.
view-if: left_in_government = 0 and krs_appointments_blocked_2026 = 1
on-arrival: {!
Q.government_procedural_restraint += 5;
Q.president_judiciary_cooperation += 2;
Q.krs_democratic_accountability += 5;
Q.court_user_trust += 4;
Q.judicial_repair_mandate += 3;
Q.ko_relation += 3;
Q.news_headline = "Lewica offers a public protocol for presidential appointments";
!}

The proposal requires deadlines and written reasons while leaving nomination
criteria in general law. Either institution can refuse; neither can hide.

- @poland_event_queue: Offer the votes

@appointments_opposition_attack
title: Make every empty bench the president's responsibility
subtitle: A sharp campaign line with no immediate capacity fix.
view-if: left_in_government = 0 and krs_appointments_blocked_2026 = 1
on-arrival: {!
Q.president_relation -= 8;
Q.president_judiciary_cooperation -= 5;
Q.judicial_repair_mandate += 6;
Q.judicial_vacancies += 2;
Q.court_backlog += 4;
Q.court_user_trust -= 2;
Q.ko_relation += 1;
Q.razem_dissent -= 2;
Q.news_headline = "Lewica campaigns on the Palace's empty benches";
!}

The line connects institutional obstruction to missed hearings. It also leaves
those hearings missed until an election changes the arithmetic.

- @poland_event_queue: Put it on the Palace
